From 193235b0242a3c9e1cd0b5c325eda3b4f4d25c29 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Piotr Oniszczuk <piotr.oniszczuk@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 18:00:54 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] media: meson: amvdec: add Amlogic S6 support

Add an S6 platform description and the "amlogic,s6-vdec" compatible,
derived from the vendor driver:

- the S4 format table, DOS-bus canvas and the T7 AV1 handling
- DMC port parking with the S6 status register (word 0xd8), VDEC_1 on
  bit 8 and HEVC on bits 6 and 7; the park masks become per-platform
- S6 relocates part of the HEVC_ASSIST block, HEVC_STREAM_CRC/VP9_ACP_CTRL
  and AV1D_IPP_DIR_CFG relative to the G12A..T7 layout; remap those
  accesses in the DOS register accessors

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../media/platform/amlogic/amvdec/amvdec.c    |  2 ++
 .../media/platform/amlogic/amvdec/amvdec_1.c  | 11 +++---
 .../platform/amlogic/amvdec/amvdec_helpers.c  | 35 +++++++++++++++++--
 .../platform/amlogic/amvdec/amvdec_hevc.c     |  5 ++-
 .../platform/amlogic/amvdec/amvdec_platform.c | 18 ++++++++++
 .../platform/amlogic/amvdec/amvdec_platform.h | 19 ++++++++++
 6 files changed, 79 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

